# smaqit-extensions confidentiality scan — path exclusions.
#
# One gitignore-style pattern per line; lines starting with # are comments.
# A path already covered by the scanner's built-in defaults (.git/,
# node_modules/, vendor/, .venv/, venv/, __pycache__/, dist/, build/,
# target/, .next/, and common lockfiles) does not need an entry here.
#
# This file is seeded once and never overwritten by `smaqit-extensions
# update` — your entries persist across installer updates. Add a path here
# only after reviewing why it trips the scan.
#
# Examples:
# fixtures/sample-keys.pem
# docs/examples/*.env
